<section class="section section-light" id="why-facets">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading-idea"><p class="kicker">THE IDEA</p><h2>Good ideas deserve<br><em>a shared home.</em></h2><p>Facets brings useful Ruby methods together in a form you can discover, reuse, and improve. Each extension stays easy to find and easy to require.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon feature-icon-circle" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="feature-number">01 / GRANULAR</p><h3>One file, one idea</h3><p>Most methods have their own file. Add a single method without loading a larger set of extensions.</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><p class="feature-number">02 / FAMILIAR</p><h3>Ruby, extended</h3><p>Build on the classes and modules you already use, from Array and String to parts of the standard library.</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p class="feature-number">03 / COMMUNITY</p><h3>Made together</h3><p>Years of contributions and refinement live in one collection, with tests and source credits alongside the code.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

